Z||000000||yunvme||02-25-2001||07:32 PM||||i got  a 86 se i put a 88 2.8 w/dis in it about a year ago,now and im only asking on here cause i cant find anything to be wrong,its misfiring at idle ,i did a complete tune up i had extra new coils and module  i also put on. nothings doing the tricki can fire the car up like nothing itll sit at around 900 and misfire open it up to about 1500 and its gone it also does it at almost w.o.t. going down the thruway its not like its got a dist to play with so im asking you guysi cant get it to stop and the cars not being driven till i figure it out.<BR>also nothing indicates problems on my scanner exhaust does seem a lil rich but nothing i cant live with||||reg||5
